[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m Let's represent \(z\) in its polar form. Since \(|z| = 4\), we can write \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m Substituting \(z = 4e^{i\theta}\) into the expression, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = (75 + 117i)4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)}.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m First, let's simplify the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m (75 + 117i)4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) = 4(75 + 117i)(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) = 4[(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) + i(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta)].
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} \cdot \frac{\cos \theta - i \sin \theta}{\cos^2 \theta + \sin^2 \theta} = \frac{24 + 36i}{1} \cdot (\cos \theta - i \sin \theta) = (24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta) + i(36 \cos \theta - 24 \sin \theta).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m Combining these, the expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m 4[(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) + i(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta)] + [(24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta) + i(36 \cos \theta - 24 \sin \theta)].
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m = (4 \cdot 75 \cos \theta - 4 \cdot 117 \sin \theta + 24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta) + i(4 \cdot 75 \sin \theta + 4 \cdot 117 \cos \theta + 36 \cos \theta - 24 \sin \theta).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \[
