[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m The real part of this expression is \(324 \cos \theta - 432 \sin \theta\). To maximize this, we need to maximize the expression \(324 \cos \theta - 432 \sin \theta\). This can be done by expressing it in the form \(R \cos(\theta + \phi)\), where \(R = \sqrt{324^2 + 432^2}\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m Let's calculate \(R\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m R = \sqrt{324^2 + 432^2} = \sqrt{104976 + 186624} = \sqrt{291600} = 540.
