[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m [response] To solve the problem, we need to maximize the real part of the expression \((75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z}\) where \(|z| = 4\). Let's represent \(z\) in its polar form as \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m First, we substitute \(z = 4e^{i\theta}\) into the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = (75 + 117i)4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m Simplifying the first term:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m (75 + 117i)4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) = 4(75 \cos \theta + 117i \cos \theta + 75i \sin \theta - 117 \sin \theta) = 4((75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) + i(117 \cos \theta + 75 \sin \theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m Simplifying the second term:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)} \cdot \frac{\cos \theta - i \sin \theta}{\cos \theta - i \sin \theta} = \frac{(96 + 144i)(\cos \theta - i \sin \theta)}{4(\cos^2 \theta + \sin^2 \theta)} = \frac{(96 \cos \theta + 144 \sin \theta) + i(144 \cos \theta - 96 \sin \theta)}{4} = 24 \cos \theta + 36i \sin \theta + 36i \cos \theta - 24i \sin \theta = 24 \cos \theta + 12i \cos \theta + 36i \sin \theta - 24 \sin \theta
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m Combining both terms:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m 4((75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) + i(117 \cos \theta + 75 \sin \theta)) + 24 \cos \theta + 12i \cos \theta + 36i \sin \theta - 24 \sin \theta
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m 
