[36m(TaskRunner pid=1996144)[0m We need to maximize \(324 \cos \theta - 492 \sin \theta\). The maximum value of \(a \cos \theta + b \sin \theta\) is \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\), so the maximum value of \(324 \cos \theta - 492 \sin \theta\) is \(\sqrt{324^2 + 492^2}\):
